            "review_text": "ozvet678\nGreenock, Australia10 contributions\n0\nNew hidden treasure in centre of HCM City.\nJul 2013 • Solo\nGo down the Art Arcade on Dong Koi street,first turn left and upstairs to Catina Cafe.Clean,fresh, with a range of seating and outside balcony overlooking Dong Koi.\nStaff are friendly and efficient for a cafe that has only been open 3 days.\nPleasant background music that does not intrude on conversation.Best coffee I have had in HCM City and I had a delicious baguette.Also try the Catina banana cake.\nDo your self a favour and and have a quite break and wonderful coffee\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 19, 2013",
